- Cause: 1071a179 dropped column_lookup.h from column_reference.h; that
  include had placed column_lookup.h at amalgamation line 18444, ahead
  of the collector (19272 at 3fdde80b). After it, column_lookup.h came
  at 22144, behind the call (19150). The CI run on 5bf091cc already
  failed; 0e6d8f8c..de5d5e06 did not cause it.
- trueqbit: yes. Fix: the collector includes column_lookup.h, which it
  calls (find_column_name, and pick_table through table_lookup.h).
  Amalgamation: column_lookup.h now at 18970, its declaration at 19004,
  the call at 19215; the removed and added lines differ only in the two
  include comments. No cycle: nothing column_lookup.h reaches includes a
  serializer.

